From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Taube <Thomastaube@gmx.de>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:46:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] gvariant: Fix an off-by-one error in an offset comparison

Fixes CVE-2026-58010. Backport of upstream commit be85f9429 (glib 2.88.1, glib#3915) to 2.82.5.

CVE: CVE-2026-58010
---
 glib/gvariant-serialiser.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/glib/gvariant-serialiser.c b/glib/gvariant-serialiser.c
index 08c2e21..bf2b24a 100644
--- a/glib/gvariant-serialiser.c
+++ b/glib/gvariant-serialiser.c
@@ -1250,7 +1250,7 @@ gvs_tuple_is_normal (GVariantSerialised value)
 
       while (offset & alignment)
         {
-          if (offset > value.size || value.data[offset] != '\0')
+          if (offset >= value.size || value.data[offset] != '\0')
             return FALSE;
           offset++;
         }
